AKBER TERA CHEHLM HOTA HAI<br>
Laila Ne Tadhap Kw Di Yeh Sada Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
Zinda Hu Main Rone Ku Beta Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
1.Main Shaam Ke Zinadan Se Chodh Kar Chehlum Ke Liye Aayi Dilbar<br>
Gurbat Me Hai Ahmed Ka Kunba Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
2.Arman Tha Teri Shadi Ka Aye Laal Wo Dil Dafan Howa<br>
Main Kisse Karu Khismat Ka Gila Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
3.Bazarou Me Jaakar Aayi Hu Darbarou Me Jaakar Aayi Hu<br>
Main Kisku Sunou Haal Mera Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
4.Suchi Thi Basaungi Basti Dulhan Teri Beta Laungi<br>
Arman Mera Meethi Me Mila Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
5.Ab Phoolou Ki Chadar Kasie Chadhe Markhad Pe Teri Aaye Laal Mere<br>
Majboor Hai Teri Main Beta Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai<br>
<br>
6.Mehmil Se Giri Jab Binte Ali Markhad Pe Baradar Ki Aaye Razi<br>
Tharayi Zameen-e-Karbobala Akber Tera Chehlum Hota Hai
